Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.21,0:00:05.47,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.41,0:00:08.98,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Want these?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.98,0:00:11.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,750)\an8\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\c&H55686E&\blur2\3c&HE0F3F7&\4c&HA5C6CF&}Accepted at Theaters Nationwide \N{\fs20\b1\3c&HB9FEFA&\4c&H8CCEC5&}Complimentary Ticket
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Movie tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.73,0:00:14.39,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Complimentary tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.39,0:00:16.70,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I got them from a coworker of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.82,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,They're good until this Sunday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:21.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And you're not going?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:23.44,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Can't. I've got work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.87,0:00:26.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Take someone with you if you're free.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:27.96,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:30.91,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks. Good luck at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:31.65,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.27,0:00:35.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A movie...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:50.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, do you like movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.31,0:00:51.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:52.30,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So tomorrow—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.30,0:00:53.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:56.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay, shall we go see a movie then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.26,0:00:58.46,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
