Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:31.00,Main,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\an1\fnTimes New Roman\bord1.5\b1\fs28\shad0\3c&H1B191E&\pos(54,310)}#03  {\fs24\fscy110}Misfortune, Followed by Sunshine
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:34.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm gonna see a movie \Nwith Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:36.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:42.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No, no! I don't have time to just \Nsit around looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.15,0:02:44.96,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Whenever we've gone out together before...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:48.06,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The weather report would say it'd be sunny,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.41,0:02:51.98,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,but then it'd suddenly start raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:59.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Or I'd drop my wallet and lose\N a whole month's allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:05.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san always just smiles \Nand acts like it's no big deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:12.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But I don't want her to suffer \Nbecause of my bad luck this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:16.60,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I've gotta prepare so I can handle \Nanything that might happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.29,0:03:18.35,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,First, umbrellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.04,0:03:22.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll take a few in case\N a sudden gust breaks one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.76,0:03:26.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll put my wallet on a string \Nto make sure I don't drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:30.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,A towel in case we get splashed \Nwith water or mud...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:34.44,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,And this... \NOh, I'll bring a water bottle, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.23,0:03:37.62,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.02,0:03:41.61,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I might've packed a little too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.83,0:03:47.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,So... heavy...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.81,0:03:51.87,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.63,0:03:53.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:58.32,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,That was a loud crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:00.59,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Yuu, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:03.90,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.58,0:04:13.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,"How to be a cute girl \Nwithout trying too hard..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:16.39,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,"Classic dresses that boyfriends love..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.39,0:04:18.66,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,"Look more girly with frills..."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.32,0:04:22.84,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,"Your date outfit is your battle uniform"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.18,0:04:39.17,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What should I wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.17,0:04:40.79,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.67,0:04:43.14,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Could you keep it down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.14,0:04:45.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm not making that much noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.78,0:04:49.00,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,You going out somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.00,0:04:49.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:56.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah... I'm going to the movies \Ntomorrow with... a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:58.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What kind of friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:05:00.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.01,0:05:01.02,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Harsh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:10.12,Main,Brother,0,0,0,,Well, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.12,0:05:16.92,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.24,0:05:18.34,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:28.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay! Today has started out\N perfectly normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:31.68,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,The strap on my bag snapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:35.56,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Then I found a lost child \Nand took her to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:40.16,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But I left home early since I knew stuff \Nlike that would happen, so we're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.28,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,All right! I'm not late!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.77,0:05:48.02,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I won't have to make \NShikimori-san wait today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.48,0:05:55.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san! There's still time\N before we were supposed to meet...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.99,0:06:05.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Good morning, Izumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:09.69,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I arrived a bit early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:14.93,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san? Do I look strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:17.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No, not strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:20.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You just look... really nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.82,0:06:23.82,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:28.00,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san is incredibly cute today!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.34,0:06:35.61,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This'll be our first time \Nseeing a movie together.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.58,Italics,Actress,0,0,0,,Ever since we left Toyko,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.91,0:06:42.31,Italics,Actress,0,0,0,,I've been in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:44.66,Italics,Actress,0,0,0,,I still am.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:01.50,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What if that actually happens?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:03.40,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:03.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:07.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Your face is red. Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.88,0:07:09.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I-I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:11.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.11,0:07:15.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm sure. I'm just too excited \Nto be seeing a movie with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.58,0:07:18.12,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I feel the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.41,0:07:25.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They've got a lot playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.41,0:07:28.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,There are so many that it's hard to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:33.37,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wonder what genres Shikimori-san likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.35,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\an3\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\pos(501.333,202.667)\shad0\c&HF1F0D4&\3c&H99856F&}No matter what happens, \NI'll keep my promise to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.35,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\pos(325.334,297.333)\c&HD9D878&\3c&HFFFFFF&\b1}Weaving the {\c&HE48296&}future {\c&HD9D878&}and the {\c&HA06ED6&}past
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.35,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,440)\an1\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\shad2\bord1\pos(160.667,268.667)\c&HFEEBFF&\3c&H9B72CE&\4c&H9B72CE&}My heart is pounding... \NWhat's happening to me?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.11,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Romance, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.01,0:07:41.27,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\pos(281.334,212)\fnArial\fs12\c&H0E191C&\shad0\bord0}A Jelly Beans & Caramel Melon Production \N{\fs14\c&H2E27CC&\b1\shad2\bord1}Almond Schazganeyer in \N{\fs30\c&H84909D&\3c&H151D8F&\4c&H3246E8&}JEANS OF SOUL
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.62,0:07:39.12,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,But she's really sporty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.12,0:07:41.26,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Maybe she's into stuff like action.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.13,0:07:44.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, which movie do you want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:48.30,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, um... Anything's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:49.89,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Whatever you want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.14,0:07:54.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You know, you always say things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:55.27,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.69,0:08:01.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You always put where I want to go, \Nwhat I want to see, or what I want to eat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:03.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Do I really...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.96,0:08:04.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.09,0:08:07.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's see the movie {\i1}you{\i0} want to see today!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.74,0:08:09.71,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.71,0:08:10.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,"Why"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.77,0:08:12.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Y-Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:15.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Because I want to know more about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.75,0:08:21.56,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Don't be shy. Just be frank with me.\N Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.07,0:08:24.02,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Which one do you want to see the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.02,0:08:26.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Um... well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.45,0:08:29.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:35.99,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimes New Roman\c&HBCDBF9&\fs20\3c&H0E1E20&\4c&H0E1E20&}The Japanese Premiere
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:35.99,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\c&HD7E7F3&}I opened the door and found\N a smiling {\c&H0F11CE&}clown{\c&HD7E7F3&}...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:35.99,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\c&HD7E7F3&\3c&H0C053B&\4c&H0C053B&}CAST \N{\fs18}Ricky Churchill \NShip Johnston \NAlexandra Toto \NShelley Rand \NAdolf Yeltsin \NMichael Chandler
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:38.26,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,H-Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.25,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fnTimes New Roman\c&HBCDBF9&\fs20\3c&H0E1E20&\4c&H0E1E20&}The Japanese Premiere
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.25,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\c&HD7E7F3&}I opened the door and found\N a smiling {\c&H0F11CE&}clown{\c&HD7E7F3&}...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.25,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\fs16\c&HD7E7F3&\3c&H0C053B&\4c&H0C053B&}CAST \N{\fs18}Ricky Churchill \NShip Johnston \NAlexandra Toto \NShelley Rand \NAdolf Yeltsin \NMichael Chandler
Dialogue: 1,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Do you know this movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.72,0:08:47.71,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's all the rage on social media. \NI've been curious about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:49.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:53.72,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnArial\fs20\c&H131509&\3c&HF0F3F1&\4c&HF0F3F1&}Prepare to be traumatized{\c&H54DEF5&\b1}! {\c&H131509&\b0}\N\NScariest movie I've seen all year \N\NNothing short of a masterpiece{\c&H3246E8&\b1}! \N\N{\c&H131509&\b0}Must-see for horror fans
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:53.38,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're right. Sounds like it's super scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:57.32,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, are you all right with horror movies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.32,0:08:59.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess I can handle them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:01.11,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:04.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Stuff like that doesn't scare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.37,0:09:09.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It does, but if it's scary, \NI just can't help wanting to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.75,0:09:12.62,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Oh, so she {\i0}does{\i1} get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:21.98,Italics,Actor,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.29,Italics,Actor,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:32.33,Italics,Actor,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.01,0:09:38.95,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm okay with splatter films,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.95,0:09:42.16,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,and I should be fine since we're in a theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.88,0:09:44.25,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:56.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:09:57.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:01.97,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll get to show \Nher how manly I can be!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:07.27,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, tell me if you get scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:08.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.77,0:10:11.18,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.78,0:10:24.08,Italics,Boy actor,0,0,0,,A balloon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.03,0:11:03.61,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This is terrifying!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:08.02,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,What the heck?! This is insanely scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:10.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Eurgh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:13.78,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'm so scared, I feel like I'm gonna puke...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.57,0:11:31.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.72,0:11:42.09,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.09,0:11:44.22,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I didn't know you'd get this scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:48.69,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry. If I hadn't said \NI wanted to see a horror movie...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:51.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.57,0:11:52.19,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.50,0:11:54.68,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,If I'd been alone, I might've passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.10,0:11:57.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Having you with me made me stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:01.93,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:05.62,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san, do you want \Nto go get something to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:06.56,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:14.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,This looks so good! And cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:17.22,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It really is cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:22.34,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\b1\fnArial\fs16\c&H6B7581&\3c&HF0FAF8&\4c&HF0FAF8&\move(318.667,331.333,318.667,270)}Walnut and Custard Cream Caramel \N{\fs20}1,800 yen {\fs14}(with tax)
Dialogue: 1,0:12:18.54,0:12:21.68,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's kind of expensive, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:25.25,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Don't worry! You can leave that to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.25,0:12:30.12,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I've been saving up in secret because \NI wanted to try this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:31.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:34.71,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Also, I just happen to have a coupon for...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:36.29,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:37.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.96,0:12:40.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What? My wallet's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:42.06,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The coupon was in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:46.19,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No way... I put my wallet on a \Nstring so I wouldn't lose it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:50.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,The string broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.68,0:12:51.71,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:56.46,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fay-.03\fry-5\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord0\b1\pos(450,38)\c&HCCB0A5&}Tachikawa Station North Exit
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.47,0:12:58.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:13:02.05,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's all right. Please don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:05.35,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I really wanted to make you happy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.35,0:13:07.01,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,but it was all for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.46,0:13:09.34,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,What? Yuu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.67,0:13:13.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Mom and Dad? \NWhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.22,0:13:15.11,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Just a little shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.11,0:13:17.73,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Nice to see you again, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:21.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,H-Hello, Father and Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.97,0:13:24.78,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,"Mother," she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.78,0:13:26.12,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:28.73,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Are you on your way somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:32.38,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Well, we were going to get pancakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.79,0:13:34.49,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,but I dropped my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.49,0:13:36.64,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.62,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Same old story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.62,0:13:40.37,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.37,0:13:43.13,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Why don't you come eat at home, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.13,0:13:46.67,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,If Shikimori-san comes with you, \Nwe'll splurge on the snacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:51.01,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, good idea! And I'll make us a feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.01,0:13:52.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.20,0:13:54.57,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It would be my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:03.53,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Eat all you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:06.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thank you! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:09.02,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I'll serve it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.24,0:14:23.41,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I-I can definitely see \Nthe family resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.41,0:14:26.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shikimori-san! \NYou didn't hurt your hand, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:27.36,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:29.17,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:36.01,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.01,0:14:38.42,Italics,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It tastes like something from a restaurant!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:40.29,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Go on. Eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:41.77,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.77,0:14:43.67,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:44.71,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.71,0:14:46.23,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Have some of this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:47.94,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.51,0:14:53.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shikimori-san. \NThey're a little overexcited.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.46,0:14:55.70,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm having a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.46,0:14:59.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since \NI had home cooking...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.22,0:15:05.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,O-Oh, I didn't mean anything serious by that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.16,0:15:06.45,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:10.33,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,You're welcome to visit our home\N anytime you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.33,0:15:12.96,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,We do tend to make too much food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.84,0:15:22.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:26.60,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I'll go get dessert ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.93,0:15:29.09,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Bathroom break for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.09,0:15:30.19,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.88,0:15:36.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming over. \NSorry for putting you on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:38.25,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.07,0:15:41.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You don't seem nervous at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:44.24,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I totally panicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.62,0:15:46.44,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:50.81,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'm in the home of the person I love. \NOf course I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.62,0:15:54.15,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,C-Could she be any cuter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.36,0:15:58.21,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Look at you, flirting in front of me.\N I could weep tears of delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.21,0:15:59.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.17,0:16:04.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Allow me to help with the dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.63,0:16:07.08,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.08,0:16:09.94,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,You can just chat with Yuu if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.94,0:16:13.13,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well... Izumi-san fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:20.99,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,He's always been the type to fall \Nasleep once his belly's full.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.99,0:16:22.74,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Isn't that adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:23.54,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Girlfriend brag?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.54,0:16:25.33,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Th-That's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.59,0:16:29.90,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I really would like to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:33.58,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,For staying by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.44,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:39.09,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Is there anything you want to ask me \Nwhile we have this chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.09,0:16:42.61,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Like to see his middle school album,\N or his baby pictures...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.61,0:16:43.31,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:48.17,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,If not, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.70,0:16:54.75,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Could I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:57.52,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You want to ask {\i1}me{\i0} something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:17:00.66,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,When he was in elementary school...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.50,0:17:03.40,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Yuu, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.40,0:17:05.43,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Make sure you watch out for cars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:08.67,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Always look up, \Nand mind where you step, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.11,0:17:12.18,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,And don't forget to check \Nbehind you as you walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:15.41,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Jeez, Mom, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.67,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,Just make sure {\i1}you{\i0} don't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:24.07,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:30.74,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,He came home with new \Ninjuries every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.74,0:17:33.77,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I got so worried, I couldn't \Nsend him off with a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.04,0:17:38.53,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,But you know, after sixteen years...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:44.13,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,It wouldn't even faze me to suddenly \Nfind a giant hole in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.13,0:17:46.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,A-Acclimation is an amazing thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:49.29,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,It actually scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:54.49,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Probably because he only ever \Nworries for other people,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:57.51,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,and with the most oblivious look on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.79,0:17:57.91,Flashback,Izumi,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.91,0:17:59.04,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Your head...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.45,0:18:01.39,Flashback,Motoko,0,0,0,,Um, never mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.87,0:18:03.63,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:08.10,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, dear. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.77,0:18:12.74,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Honestly, where does he get it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:14.62,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It certainly is a mystery...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.03,0:18:17.10,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,But that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:22.10,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,I just hope you won't \Nlose patience with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.03,0:18:26.81,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,After all, I'm sure his bad luck
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.81,0:18:29.62,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,will cause you some hardship as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:31.46,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.85,0:18:36.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You're right that Izumi-san \Nruns into trouble quite often.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:40.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Maybe others see him as \Nunfortunate because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:42.86,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But as for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.00,0:18:48.27,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I have never once thought of him that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:52.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,His nature is not a flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.01,0:18:58.06,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think being so unlucky \Nis what makes him so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:18:59.91,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Plus...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:03.96,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san understands \Npain better than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:07.88,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But in spite of that, \Nhe never pities himself
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.88,0:19:10.59,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,and he's able to show concern for others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.85,0:19:18.14,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san san is so strong and admirable.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:21.07,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:24.36,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I'll protect him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.69,0:19:28.02,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.02,0:19:32.93,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh... I'm starting to \Nwish you were {\i1}my{\i0} girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.93,0:19:33.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.21,0:19:37.61,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Having an affair in front of me? I could cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.61,0:19:39.21,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Oh, you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.21,0:19:40.03,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.75,0:19:46.03,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Yuu. Yuu, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:52.63,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,It's already eight o'clock. \NMii-chan is going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.68,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What? It's already that late?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:57.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I need to walk her—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.07,0:20:02.54,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:04.07,Main,Akisada/Shikimori,0,0,0,,A gaming tournament!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:12.63,Main,Akisada,0,0,0,,Not bad, Mii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:14.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Same to you, Akisada-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:17.98,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,They bonded before I even knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.88,0:20:21.42,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Well, thank you for having me over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:23.49,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Mii-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:27.05,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,Come over whenever you want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.05,0:20:27.99,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:30.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.09,0:20:40.48,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I'll walk Shikimori-san home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:46.51,Main,Motoko,0,0,0,,You take care now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:54.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry about everything today, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.74,0:20:56.42,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I even fell asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.42,0:20:58.85,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I enjoyed getting to see your sleeping face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.49,0:21:01.90,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I don't sleep with my eyes open, do I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.48,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:08.10,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What kinds of movies do you like, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.81,0:21:13.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hmm... I guess I like \Nstories about friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.29,0:21:20.26,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Then why don't we see \Nsomething like that next time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.81,0:21:22.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.54,0:21:25.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,When should we go again?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.93,0:21:31.14,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I think there's a new buddy film\Ncoming out next month.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.57,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's go see it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.57,0:21:33.27,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.78,0:22:36.75,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(560,440)\fnArial\b1\fs30\frz7\shad0\3c&HDBE6E5&\c&H5126E8&\pos(498,297.999)}S{\fs28\c&H3DCEFE&}E{\fs26\c&H5126E8&}E {\fs26\c&H3DCEFE&}Y{\fs24\c&H5126E8&}O{\fs22\c&H3DCEFE&}U{\c&H5126E8&}~
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.02,0:23:11.01,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Oh, I got a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.01,0:23:12.08,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,From a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.30,0:23:14.40,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,No, it's from Motoko-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.72,0:23:15.90,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Motoko-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.91,0:23:23.91,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\an7\fs20\c&HF8F7E1&\3c&H6B5A2F&\4c&H6B5A2F&}Izumi Motoko\N\N{\an7\fnArial\fs20\c&H56544B&\3c&HF6F2DE&\4c&HFEFDF0&}Why don't we go and learn \Nhow to make meat and potato \Nstew together?\N\NIn a cooking class
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.48,0:23:20.79,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Apparently, Shikimori-san really \Nhas a way with older folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.94,0:23:23.91,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\an6\fnArial\fs20\c&H56544B&\3c&HF6F2DE&\4c&HFEFDF0&}I'd love to!!
